<https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl#bob> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#agent> <https://bob.ex/card#me> <https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl> .
<https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl#bob> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#mode> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read> <https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl> .
<https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl#owner> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Authorization> <https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl> .
<https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl#owner> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#accessTo> <https://pod.ex/friends3/> <https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl> .
<https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl#owner> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#agent> <https://alice.ex/card#me> <https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl> .
<https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl#owner> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#mode> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read> <https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl> .
<https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl#owner> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#mode> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Write> <https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl> .
<https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl#owner> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#mode> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Control> <https://pod.ex/friends3/.acl> .
# mixed4/.acl: any AUTHENTICATED agent reads members; alice owns
<https://pod.ex/mixed4/.acl#authd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Authorization> <https://pod.ex/mixed4/.acl> .
