<https://pod.ex/mixed4/own.ttl.acl#doc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Authorization> <https://pod.ex/mixed4/own.ttl.acl> .
